{"ref":"BDB, חָסִיל","hw":"חָסִיל","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חָסִיל</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> a kind of <strong>locust</strong> (sg. coll.), always abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span>, and always as destructive; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:37\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.37\">1 K 8:37</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 6:28\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.6.28\">2 Ch 6:28</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:46\" href=\"/Psalms.78.46\">ψ 78:46</a> (all ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אַרְבֶּה</span>), <a data-ref=\"Joel 1:4\" href=\"/Joel.1.4\">Jo 1:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joel 2:25\" href=\"/Joel.2.25\">2:25</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יָ֑לֶק</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אַרְבֶּה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּוָם</span>); cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֹסֶף הֶחָ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.33.4\">Is 33:4</a> <em>the gathering of the locust</em>, in sim. of despoiling of Assyria (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">גֵּבִים</span>).","next":"BDB, חָסַם","prev":"BDB, חָסַל"}